sequenceDiagram
  participant EventSvc as EventService
  participant Sink as HookSink
  participant Hook as CustomerHook
  participant Blocking as UserProfilePreUpdate payload
  participant EffectCtx as MutationsEffectContext
  participant StdAttrs as StandardAttributesService
  participant CustomAttrs as CustomAttributesService
  participant Store as user.Store
  participant DB as _auth_user

  Note over EventSvc: 事务 commit 后
  EventSvc->>Sink: RunBlockingEvent(UserProfilePreUpdate, payload)
  Sink->>Hook: HTTP 请求 hook
  Hook-->>Sink: { is_allowed, mutations: { user: { standard_attributes, custom_attributes, ... } } }
  Sink->>Blocking: ApplyHookResponse(response)
  Blocking->>Blocking: ApplyUserMutations(UserModel, response.Mutations.User)
  Blocking-->>Sink: MutationsEverApplied
  Sink->>Blocking: PerformEffects(ctx, effectCtx)
  Blocking->>EffectCtx: PerformEffectsOnUser(ctx, effectCtx, userID, userMutations)
  EffectCtx->>StdAttrs: UpdateStandardAttributes(ctx, RoleGreatest, userID, mutations.StandardAttributes)
  EffectCtx->>CustomAttrs: UpdateAllCustomAttributes(ctx, RoleGreatest, userID, mutations.CustomAttributes)
  Note over StdAttrs,CustomAttrs: 再次走与 6.1/6.2 相同的校验与落库
  StdAttrs->>Store: (经 NoEvent 校验后) UpdateStandardAttributes
  CustomAttrs->>Store: (经 NoEvent 校验后) UpdateCustomAttributes
  Store->>DB: UPDATE standard_attributes / custom_attributes
  DB-->>Store: OK
  Store-->>EffectCtx: nil
  EffectCtx-->>Blocking: nil
  Blocking-->>Sink: nil
  Sink-->>EventSvc: nil
